			"notes": "- Joining a server and starting the game are much faster with many modded blocks: loading the models of doors, trapdoors and fence gates no longer slows down every other block.\n- Rejoining a server in the same game skips reloading its textures and models when nothing on the server changed.\n- The first player to join after a server starts no longer waits while the server packs its content.\n- Every client downloads the server's textures once more after this update, then keeps them as before."
		},
