			"notes": "- Joining a server you have joined before skips downloading its textures, models and sounds: your game keeps the last few servers' sets and the server only sends them when they have changed.\n- Servers no longer hand out Pandorical or other client mods, and the game no longer offers to install them. Keep your mods up to date with your launcher.\n- A slow download of a server's textures no longer trips a timer meant for older servers partway through joining."
